      "title": "A mountain village overlooking an unforgettable sea",
      "description_paragraphs": [
        "Dhërmi is one of the most atmospheric destinations on the Albanian Riviera, where a historic hilltop village looks down toward a spectacular stretch of Ionian coastline. Traditional stone houses, narrow lanes and old churches give the village a distinctive character.",
        "Below the historic village, the coastline unfolds into a series of beaches, coves and crystal-clear waters. The combination of mountains and sea makes Dhërmi particularly appealing to travelers who want both relaxation and outdoor adventure.",
