        "The surrounding mountains provide opportunities for hiking and scenic drives, particularly around the Llogara Pass and Cika Mountain. The elevated landscapes create spectacular views over the Ionian Sea.",
        "Dhërmi's restaurants and beachside venues serve fresh seafood, grilled meats, traditional Albanian dishes and Mediterranean-inspired cuisine, making the local food scene an important part of the experience."
